  message: "Folded into WI-tosum (owner-approved 2026-10-03). Not done as a standalone refactor: by itself it changes no edges and fixes no bug, since the bugs sit in the per-language declaration-type lists, which a pure refactor keeps unchanged. Its value is making INV-midag's gate verify one core function instead of a name pattern, which is WI-tosum's job. The core helper it proposed now exists (analyze/base.py:1419 enclosing_declared_symbol, INV-bamij). Its 21-analyzer list and its edge-set-diff acceptance are carried on WI-tosum."  # 6e6d
